<title>INDONESIA: Bank Panin 1996 net up to 80.18 bln rph.</title>
<headline>Bank Panin 1996 net up to 80.18 bln rph.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>				(in billions of rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				80.18  vs   50.04</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (rupiah)	 266    vs   189</p>
<p>    Net interest income		  200.29  vs 163.59</p>
<p>    Other operating income		72.46  vs  49.30</p>
<p>    Other operating expenses	    155.63 vs 123.83</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			  117.03 vs  78.47</p>
<p>    Retained earnings		     207.92 vs 140.78</p>
<p>NOTE: The results were audited. PT Pan Indonesia Bank (Bank Panin), a member of the widely-diversified conglomerate Panin Group, is a medium-sized bank.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
